# 2-Nitrophenol  pKa=7.220
# Ortho NO2: intramolecular H-bond stabilises phenol OH, raising pKa
# above what pure inductive effect predicts. Compare 4-NO2 (7.15).
# The near-equal pKa of 2- and 4-NO2 phenol illustrates that ortho
# H-bond and para resonance cancel, an important structural insight.

